<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Cah Ayu Cintaku 🤍</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fbc2eb, #a6c1ee);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 26px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      max-width: 360px;
      animation: fade 1.2s ease;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #ff5c8a;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    p {
      color: #444;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    button {
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #ff7aa2;
      color: white;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    @keyframes fade {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <h1>🤍 Cah Ayu 🤍</h1>

    <p>
      Dijaga iyaa kesehatannya 🌱  
      Jangan lupa makan 🍽️  
      Jangan lupa mandi 🚿  
      Jangan lupa sholat 🤍
    </p>

    <p>
      Jangan kebut-kebutan 🛵  
      Jangan makan pedas kebanyakan 🌶️  
      Jangan begadang 🌙
    </p>

    <p>
      Kalau ada masalah, cerita-cerita iyaa 🫂  
      Jangan disimpan walaupun sebentar 🥺
    </p>

    <p>
      Cah ayu cintaku, semestaku,  
      rumahku, duniaku yang ke-2 💕
    </p>

    <button onclick="playMusic()">🎵 Putar Lagu Lembut</button>

    <audio id="music">
      <source src="https://cdn.pixabay.com/download/audio/2022/10/25/audio_45b0c3b5a0.mp3?filename=soft-piano-ambient-122391.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    </audio>
  </div>

  <script>
    function playMusic() {
      document.getElementById("music").play();
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
